    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cp local-id=\"ed32ae71ad75\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser Story\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"103c915aa648\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b38f9dba351f\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a\u003c/strong\u003e system user\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c4c9f860608e\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI want to\u003c/strong\u003e be able to update Request for disconnection of the power supply\u0027s data\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"5b83985937b2\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that\u003c/strong\u003e I will have possibility to correct my mistake\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4cdcaac35491\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2410be200503\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003eDesign:\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://xd.adobe.com/view/fda07cd7-2bcc-4d3e-9570-763f6c8eb8c4-a8f3/\"\u003eRequest for disconnection of the power supply (adobe.com)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"7cb4dccb8c64\" /\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f84126aa009d\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAcceptance criteria:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"c3a1ba3e8905\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"a3d22b1b097e\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c5fbb2629f61\"\u003eCheck system user permissions to see edit icon on Request for disconnection of the power supply\u0027s listing/detail page. If no such permission, edit icon will be disabled\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"c946e3c3ddf7\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"0dda78e1a7c4\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"dfb9bd5e7126\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEdit Draft Request for disconnection of the power supply\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"734cabc51153\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"7d929103439f\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"8b220ef44d8f\"\u003eAllows to edit all Request for disconnection of the power supplies\u0027 objects with status Draft\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"66d68fea425c\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"12a1f231804c\"\u003eIt is possible to edit only Draft object and Executed. objects with the status \u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eFee charged \u003c/span\u003eshould be locked and it is not possible to edit\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"b8f5402c6586\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d61861979f5d\"\u003eClicking on an edit icon on listing/detail page will allow edit mode\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"22801d3388ea\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"caa6e6bc681c\"\u003eAll fields are editable with the regular flow for \u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eDraft object\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"f6f4fb6390d6\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"09266880e2f4\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"33c8752d095b\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eList of PODs should be updated when object is with status Draft and is opened in Edit mode. If for POD all overdue liabilities are payed the POD should be removed from the list.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"833647cf-db10-4b2a-8756-4b4763c35d01\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"44bb844dc031\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003ePODs listed on the second tab (POD tab) are filtered according to the Supplier type selected on the request header and the customer from the linked Reminder for disconnection:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"4babbdeb-bd78-4f8a-b5ec-af89393d2ea1\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"b192c0dc-35dc-42b6-83dc-946c35faf7a1\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"27d926a89acd\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eIf Supplier type is Current, only PODs that are active on the current date in the contract of the customer (customer ID) included in the reminder are listed.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"bc3e25c8-f3e5-4e2a-ae12-e3fc8bddbdce\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b7567aa71987\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eIf Supplier type is Previous, only PODs that are not active on the current date in the contract of that customer (from the reminder) are listed.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"e48ba4c0-ff04-46da-b84e-67567acf5589\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"9a92183bfbc2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eThis filter applies when the POD tab is loaded or refreshed (including after changing Supplier type, Grid operator, or Reminder for disconnection on tab 1).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"773687c17467\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"34da039f0b32\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eFor Executed objects it is possible to edit only:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"b019501bd4b7\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"055d83bc50e4\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c0ce9f8542bf\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eFiles \u0026ndash; to be able to upload new files or to delete manually uploaded files\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"a41a2707d519\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f22a9bd2db11\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eButton Charge fee is accessible for Executed object\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"4279ea5b5583\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"49868b6c9d2a\"\u003eCharge fee button process -\u003ca href=\"https://app.diagrams.net/?splash=0#G1Lnk3MdD3DByEpPN8s1-BCLJC3H4yxrr2#%7B%22pageId%22%3A%22JsA6_ep1HPjiPbuoDtFs%22%7D\"\u003ehttps://app.diagrams.net/?splash=0#G1Lnk3MdD3DByEpPN8s1-BCLJC3H4yxrr2#{\u0026quot;pageId\u0026quot;%3A\u0026quot;JsA6_ep1HPjiPbuoDtFs\u0026quot;}\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"efa7d5a6ff9d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4ff1f15bf7b0\"\u003eWhen object is saved as a Draft and user opens it (preview/edit modes), system should check if the Overdue liabilities are paid or not. \u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"cdc82e386104\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"55c557f9c275\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1163b10f306f\"\u003eIf paid, such respective rows from the listing should be removed\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"83cd2e62c85e\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"57ea0723107c\"\u003eWhen object is saved as a Draft and user opens it (preview/edit modes), system should check if there are another Overdue liabilities found in the system according to the conditions and should display additional rows in the listing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"6a0d428203c1\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"49ef02538f94\"\u003eWhen object is saved and Executed and user opens it on edit/preview modes, only the already executed data should be displayed in the listing and system shouldn\u0027t check anything \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"82c4f7532585\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"bf5f00b2c83f\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTask\u0027s\u003c/strong\u003e sub-object should be enable and optional in all flows - when object is Draft, Executed or \u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(7,71,166);\"\u003eFee Charged\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"aae141cffc14\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"ffa29e250759\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"eceb3e4bedef\"\u003eClicking on Plus button will open Task\u0027 creation page where Request for disconnection of the power supply object should be already set as a sub-object\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"41685f6a650f\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"f974b80bc036\"\u003eSeparate editing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"5bcfdf337a4b\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d0aa22b31148\"\u003eAfter creating a Task and clicking on Refresh button, newly created task should be set with the following logic:\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"71a402962fab\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"870e75d674dd\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"7e3e960b71dc\"\u003eTask number-Creation date-Task type\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"eceae7d8eaf1\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2ba576688939\"\u003eIt is possible to click already added record or an arrow and system should open task\u0027s page in new browser window\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"6457b17a9ed3\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"be4bfb76acce\"\u003eIt is possible to remove already added task from the Request for disconnection of the power supply object\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"6f30a4307576\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"13fb0852f9c6\"\u003eClicking on \u0027\u003cstrong\u003eSave as a draft\u003c/strong\u003e\u0027 button will update Request for disconnection of the power supply object\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"8efbdb55488c\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"faecfb77e876\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"438bcdeb8268\"\u003eSystem will check all validations and if successful will save changes, else error\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"1d8629de8e24\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"dc9a0421520e\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eClicking on \u0027\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eSave and execute\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003e\u0027 button will update Request for disconnection of the power supply object and will start process of generating documents for Grid operator, and will change status to Executed\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"e549fc35fddd\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"1feb346dee1a\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"8c615a97a2a8\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eSystem will check all validations and if successful will save changes, else error\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"b80bc60fa892\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"edec3ecfa466\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eWhen Executed object is opened for editing \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eSave, Cancel\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003e and \u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eCharge fee\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003e buttons should be visible\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"5088b6c10d17\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"a33ec6e0ace3\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"232011a302c2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eClicking on \u0027\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eCharge fee\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003e\u0027 button will start process of generating taxes for each of the selected PODs for which executed Cancelation of the request does not exist, and will change status to Fee charged\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"619efd9c8d1b\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"022024241444\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(76,154,255);\"\u003eWhen Fee Charged object  is opened for editing Cancel button should be visible\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"10c50d20b2ec\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"3ddecce250d9\"\u003eWhen clicking on \u0027\u003cstrong\u003eCancel\u003c/strong\u003e\u0027 or \u0027\u003cstrong\u003eX\u003c/strong\u003e\u0027 button should check changes and if there are changes made then warning pop-up message comes out with buttons: \u0027Your changes are not saved, are you sure you want to cancel?\u0027 Yes/No\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"578fd9ad50b1\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"ea786ba0aa96\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"1563de978b3b\"\u003eYes - will close request for disconnection of the power supply\u0027s editing page and return to listing page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"48d8eead4db5\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"bede0b32aa2d\"\u003eNo - will close warning pop-up and stay on request for disconnection of the power supply\u0027s editing page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"cefdb2947e07\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"24153e555746\"\u003eWarning message should be managed from the system settings\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"600478a393cf\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"92cf4714f47b\"\u003eAudit Log record should be created\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"48468ab98d17\"\u003eCustomer Feedbacks: \u003ca href=\"https://oppa-support.atlassian.net/browse/PDT-2999\" local-id=\"7081d38abdae\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\"\u003ehttps://oppa-support.atlassian.net/browse/PDT-2999\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e",
